WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.098
Tina: These rocks are blocking the path.

2
00:00:15.099 --> 00:00:17.842
Danny: There has to be a way past them.

3
00:00:17.843 --> 00:00:22.414
Brad: Let’s take a closer look.

4
00:00:22.415 --> 00:00:24.967
Brad: I don’t see an opening anywhere.

5
00:00:24.968 --> 00:00:28.560
Danny: I’m going to climb up and see what I can find.

6
00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:31.225
Tina: Be careful, Danny.

7
00:00:31.226 --> 00:00:35.082
Danny: Ouch, that hurt.

8
00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:37.752
Brad: Where’s your horse, Tina?

9
00:00:37.753 --> 00:00:44.185
Tina: Aw, look. She’s hungry.

10
00:00:44.186 --> 00:00:47.438
Brad: I’m glad your horse was hungry.

11
00:00:47.439 --> 00:00:49.599
I think she found an opening.

12
00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:54.223
Tina: Good girl!

13
00:00:54.224 --> 00:00:56.386
Brad: It looks dark in there.

14
00:00:56.387 --> 00:01:00.073
Danny: No problem.

15
00:01:00.074 --> 00:01:02.648
Danny: I think this will help.

16
00:01:02.649 --> 00:01:08.005
Tina: Good-bye and thank you.

17
00:01:08.006 --> 00:01:12.656
Danny: Okay, follow me!

18
00:01:12.657 --> 00:01:16.094
Danny: Stay close together, you guys.

19
00:01:16.095 --> 00:01:18.686
Brad: This is a really long tunnel.

20
00:01:18.687 --> 00:01:20.344
Danny: We’re almost there.

21
00:01:20.345 --> 00:01:33.089
I can see an opening up ahead.

22
00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:35.927
Brad: This isn’t going to be easy.

23
00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:38.182
Tina: We just need to be careful.

24
00:01:38.183 --> 00:01:42.607
Take one step at a time.

25
00:01:42.608 --> 00:01:45.271
Danny: It’s too dangerous.

26
00:01:45.272 --> 00:01:47.619
Brad: We’ve come this far, Danny.

27
00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:49.795
We can’t turn back now.

28
00:01:49.796 --> 00:01:51.211
Danny: I know.

29
00:01:51.212 --> 00:01:54.589
Tina: Hopian told you to use your imagination, right?

30
00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:56.368
Danny: That’s the problem.

31
00:01:56.369 --> 00:02:01.100
I can’t imagine climbing up this mountain!

32
00:02:01.101 --> 00:02:02.914
Tina: Close your eyes.

33
00:02:02.915 --> 00:02:05.529
Imagine yourself at the top.

34
00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:09.389
Tina: Imagine that you’ve made it there safely.

35
00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.770
Danny: Okay.

36
00:02:10.771 --> 00:02:13.247
Tina: Imagine us defeating Tristay.

37
00:02:13.248 --> 00:02:16.673
Imagine rescuing Hopian and Bello.

38
00:02:16.674 --> 00:02:19.354
Danny: Okay.

39
00:02:19.355 --> 00:02:21.786
Tina: Did you picture it clearly?

40
00:02:21.787 --> 00:02:23.047
Danny: Yes.

41
00:02:23.048 --> 00:02:24.925
Tina: Open your eyes.

42
00:02:24.926 --> 00:02:27.981
Everything you pictured is going to happen, Danny.

43
00:02:27.982 --> 00:02:30.951
Tina: You imagined it, so it will be true.

44
00:02:30.952 --> 00:02:39.754
Tina: We will make it up the mountain─one step at a time. I’ll lead.

45
00:02:39.755 --> 00:02:43.171
Tina: Be careful here.

46
00:02:43.172 --> 00:02:45.948
Brad: Whoa! That was close.

47
00:02:45.949 --> 00:02:51.476
Danny: Go slowly. Just take one step at a time.

48
00:02:51.477 --> 00:03:00.386
Tina: Why don’t we hold hands?

49
00:03:00.387 --> 00:03:04.188
Brad: You’re almost there, Danny.

50
00:03:04.189 --> 00:03:06.230
Danny: You were right, Tina.

51
00:03:06.231 --> 00:03:09.518
We just had to take one step at a─

52
00:03:09.519 --> 00:03:14.739
Tina: Danny! Brad!
